{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122040","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1012204001:0":{"text":"まだこのリーフベアーの相手をするんですかい？こんな大声で叫ばれたら、仲間が寄ってくるんじゃ……？","source_cn":"咱还要跟这头叶角熊耗下去吗？它叫得太响了，我怕它会引来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB149ADD95612EDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012204002:0":{"text":"だらしねえな！リーフベアーぐらいで何をビビってんだ！","source_cn":"看你那怂样！区区一只叶角熊你也怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8948D8E75734074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012204003:0":{"text":"なかなかしぶてぇ野郎だな。理性を失わないように、自分で自分を殴ってやがる。いいねぇ、自分に容赦ねぇ奴は好きだぜ！","source_cn":"这家伙还挺顽强，它一直在攻击自己，用痛苦维持理智。我就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA1E644B136DD7C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012204004:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">丸薬</style>はもうねぇのか？もっと食わせろ！もうちょっとで言うことを聞きそうだ。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>小药丸</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B2650A65389A465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012204005:0":{"text":"もうありやしませんよ……ボスも知ってるでしょ、金麦村で問題が起きて、ウィステリア・クリスタルが足りないせいで、商会もこれ以上丸薬を用意できないって。","source_cn":"没了头儿……你也知道，金穗村那边出了点乱子，藤水晶不够...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB6E96F99226CC71","variant_status":"","male":"","fema